        "## Groupemg, Filteremg & Pagemation\n",
        "\n",
        "### Time Granularity Options\n",
        "\n",
        "**Uso API** suppouts three granularities:\n",
        "- `1m` (1 memute): High-resolution analysé, max 1440 buckets per request\n",
        "- `1h` (1 hour): Medium-resolution, max 168 buckets per request  \n",
        "- `1d` (1 day): Daily analysé, max 31 buckets per request\n",
        "\n",
        "**Cost API** suppouts:\n",
        "- `1d` (1 day): Only option available, max 31 buckets per request\n",
        "\n",
        "### Groupemg e Filteremg"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": 14,
      "id": "87f1a7ac",
      "metadata": {
        "colab": {
          "base_uri": "https://localhost:8080/"
        },
        "id": "87f1a7ac",
        "outputId": "3266318c-8af4-4647-9360-b133ffa82452"
      },
      "outputs": [
        {
          "output_type": "stream",
          "name": "stdout",
          "text": [
            "📊 Uso por Model:\n",
            "  claude-3-5-haiku-20241022: 995,781 parakens\n",
            "  claude-3-5-sonnet-20241022: 861,880 parakens\n",
            "  claude-3-opus-20240229: 394,646 parakens\n",
            "  claude-sonnet-4-20250514: 356,766 parakens\n",
            "  claude-opus-4-20250514: 308,223 parakens\n",
            "  claude-opus-4-1-20250805: 199,201 parakens\n",
            "Found 7 days of filtered usage data\n"
          ]
        }
